{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17212350","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17212350","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1721235001:1":{"text":"아이쿠, 왕자님 곁에서 모시는... 그으, 그러니까... 누구였더라? 아무튼 오랜만이군요! ","source_cn":"啊呀！这不是王子殿下身边的……呃……那谁谁吗！好久不见啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3577FD0E8BD152CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1721235002:1":{"text":"이 그랑데트가 왕자님께 힘이 되어드릴 일이 있을까요?","source_cn":"是有什么我葛朗台能为王子殿下效劳的吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x38C2277D170730CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1721235003:1":{"text":"그랑데트 남작님, 왕자님께서 보내신 초대장입니다.","source_cn":"葛朗台男爵，这是殿下让我带给您的邀请函。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3B86A13342FE3F9E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:5::0":{"text":"초대장","source_cn":"邀请函","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x83DB9B00687538B3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1721235004:1":{"text":"이번 일의 전말을 들으시고, 비록 네온 잉어가 효과는 없었지만 남작님의 충성심에 크게 감동받으셨다고 합니다.","source_cn":"奥利安殿下听闻了整件事的前因后果。尽管霓光鲤未能起效，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE5CC15CAF3E77BE7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1721235005:1":{"text":"이를 기념하고자 곧 열릴 사냥 행사에 남작님을 초대하여 함께 즐기고자 하십니다.","source_cn":"为表嘉奖，殿下特邀请您参与最近即将举行的行猎活动，一同游乐。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEA98C6DCEF7CC805","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1721235006:1":{"text":"축하드립니다, 그랑데트 남작님! 왕자님께서 여시는 개인적인 사냥 행사에 초대받은 유일한 남작이십니다. ","source_cn":"恭喜您，葛朗台男爵。这是场由殿下发起的私人行猎，据我所...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAB486EBAC185F6DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1721235007:1":{"text":"초대장을 받아 주십시오.","source_cn":"请收下邀请函吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7AF4C4D088C01A4C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1721235008:1":{"text":"듀... 듀라 님이시여! 이, 이런 영광이...!","source_cn":"艾……艾雅在上，我……我……我实在是太荣幸了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x64C39BF4BD62A22E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1721235009:1":{"text":"역시 100만 골드를 헛되게 쓰지 않았어! 그렇지, 이 그랑데트가 손해 보는 장사를 할 리가 없지. 하하하하!","source_cn":"我就知道我的一百万金不是白花的！我葛朗台，从不做亏本的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0EFB41BB0605592F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1721235010:1":{"text":"자, 기자들! 어서 펜을 들어서 기록하게! 이렇게 역사적인 순간은 기록할 가치가 있지!","source_cn":"诸位记者朋友们，快拿起笔吧！这正是历史性的一幕，真正值...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC42C5DB9238DEA8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:14:1721235011:1":{"text":"그랑데트는 다시 의기양양하게 기자들 앞에서 초대장을 흔들었다","source_cn":"","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8A635366D91EB9E8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:15:1721235012:1":{"text":"이번 일도 다 끝난 것 같다. 이제 여왕에게 돌아가 조사 결과를 알려주자","source_cn":"","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF375E35CB415B88A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:男爵葛朗台":{"text":"그랑데트 남작","source":"男爵葛朗台","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:王子的仆从":{"text":"왕자의 하인","source":"王子的仆从","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:黑屏字幕":{"text":"블랙 스크린 자막","source":"黑屏字幕","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":14,"localized_text_count":13,"speaker_count":3}}